                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Fun, short, really scratches the itch of those old flash games you used to get on Newgrounds. It's fun to play for a round or two in between work or study. The sprites are nice and clean and the backgrounds are really beautiful. I thought it would be kind of simple and too easy, but you can get into (and out of!) some tricky pinches with well-placed abilities. The scramble mode is very fun too, giving you a look into different synergies and strategies with ships from across the three factions.",
